# Copy to .env for local development. Keep real keys out of Git and chat.
# Recommended: free Brevo account, verified sender and an API key (not SMTP key).
# Configured email also requires a code at signup and every new sign-in.
# Leave EMAIL_PROVIDER empty to select Brevo when its key exists, otherwise Resend.
EMAIL_PROVIDER=
BREVO_API_KEY= 
# Alternative provider; only the selected provider's key is needed.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Use a sender you verify with your selected provider.
# Example: MAIL_FROM=Synergy <your-verified-sender@your-domain.com>
MAIL_FROM=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4.1-mini
# Set true to test the public verification requirement locally.
REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=false
SYNERGY_DATA_FILE=.data/synergy.json
# HOST=127.0.0.1
# PORT=4173
